---
title: "decryptSealedBid (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_published: decryptSealedBid(encryptedAmount, salt, investor)
    q_check_published --> q_check_salt: privateKey is published (resultsPublished == true)
    q_check_published --> q_revert_not_published: PrivateKeyNotPublished
    q_check_salt --> q_decrypt: salt == uint256(uint160(investor))
    q_check_salt --> q_revert_salt: SaltMismatch
    q_decrypt --> q_return: ECIES.decrypt(privateKey, encryptedAmount, salt)
    q_return --> [*]: return decryptedTokenAmount
    q_revert_not_published --> [*]: revert PrivateKeyNotPublished
    q_revert_salt --> [*]: revert SaltMismatch

    note right of q_decrypt
        INV-001: decryption is deterministic given (privateKey, encryptedAmount, salt)
        INV-002: anyone can verify bids after private key publication
        INV-003: no state changes (view-like function)
    end note
